  of INFRA=1, and only a manual re-run resolves it. Evidence:
  adversarial-gate-test-s1.log ("NEW FAILURE: test packages/math-content has a new
  diagnostic" after 89 EDQUOT file failures) and the clean re-run. Default
  disposition: no change; the strategy section 2 re-run rule covers it.

Question for the orchestrator (with default):
